Hello, Nami. No way.

63
00:04:42,440 --> 00:04:43,837
It has a face, too?

64
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:45,920
This is weird!

65
00:04:46,540 --> 00:04:47,370
Jeepers!

66
00:04:47,520 --> 00:04:49,020
It's so cute!

67
00:04:50,320 --> 00:04:52,360
Ma-ma-ma-ma-ha!

68
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:55,506
