Last I saw, that other cloud ate you!

87
00:05:56,840 --> 00:05:59,075
How the heck did you end up like this?

88
00:06:00,020 --> 00:06:01,357
That was weird.

89
00:06:01,440 --> 00:06:05,100
After Mama grabbed me, my
spirit started leaving my body.

90
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:07,640
Finish him off, Hera!

91
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:13,120
I was lost in a daze. Powerless.

92
00:06:13,320 --> 00:06:16,280
And that Lady Hera was gonna couple me up!

93
00:06:18,800 --> 00:06:20,800
I'll give you a snack out of pity!

94
00:06:21,320 --> 00:06:23,300
Eat them and run, okay, girl?

95
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:25,830
Hurry!

96
00:06:26,520 --> 00:06:29,932
Then you stretched out your
weapon and offered me a snack!

97
00:06:30,260 --> 00:06:31,940
Eat them! Come on!

98
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:33,380
Wake up!

99
00:06:34,100 --> 00:06:35,337
Here I go!

100
00:06:35,420 --> 00:06:37,300
Oh, it's dinner time for moi.

101
00:06:38,740 --> 00:06:43,093
Anyhow, I guess when Hera bit me, it
smushed my body into your rod thingy.

102
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:45,337
And just like magic...

103
00:06:45,420 --> 00:06:47,700
Mama came back to life, good as new.

104
00:06:48,660 --> 00:06:52,307
Well, that's fine for you, but
it's a pain in the butt for me.

105
00:06:52,900 --> 00:06:53,730
Oh, wait.

106
00:06:53,940 --> 00:06:56,797
