123
00:07:40,660 --> 00:07:45,189
Because of her, our gifters started
betraying each other one after the other!

124
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:49,160
She even got Big Mom on her side! No way!

125
00:07:49,340 --> 00:07:52,634
She took that attack from Big
Mom and got right back up?

126
00:07:53,440 --> 00:07:55,580
Pei-Pei got beat up because of you!

127
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:58,593
I thought I told you to leave her alone!

128
00:08:02,500 --> 00:08:03,330
What?

129
00:08:05,860 --> 00:08:07,860
I've never seen it do that before!

130
00:08:08,060 --> 00:08:10,717
Mommy, just use your
baton like you always do!

131
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:12,388
I'll add attacks of my own!

132
00:08:12,620 --> 00:08:14,797
Your skin's too tough
for us to break through!

133
