insides like Mama's attack did.

134
00:08:20,500 --> 00:08:23,097
One good lightning blast
should do the trick.

135
00:08:23,180 --> 00:08:25,474
No, that'll cause too much destruction.

136
00:08:29,440 --> 00:08:31,300
