fighters and the Rebels had 3,000.

149
00:09:20,260 --> 00:09:21,090
However,

150
00:09:21,173 --> 00:09:23,477
all of the pleasures and
waiters on the performance

151
00:09:23,560 --> 00:09:26,442
floor seemed to have turned
against Master Queen.

152
00:09:26,780 --> 00:09:29,660
So the enemy gained 4,000 recruits.

153
00:09:30,180 --> 00:09:31,120
At present,

154
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:36,960
the Beast Pirates have roughly 20,000
troops and the Rebels have roughly 7,000.

155
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:41,722
