flirt revolted against Master Queen?

164
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:08,040
What, do they have a death wish?

165
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:10,037
Yeah, not very smart, are they?

166
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:11,200
Don't they get it?

167
